  "releaseNotes": "0.6.0-preview.1: Apply-only aggregate governance. New Arham.Foundation.Analyzers (Roslyn) is bundled transitively into Arham.Foundation.Core (analyzers/dotnet/cs) and enforces the Apply-only aggregate style on any type whose base chain includes AggregateRoot<TId>: AGG001 (no public mutator besides Apply), AGG002 (no public/internal setter), AGG003 (parameterless ctor only), AGG004 (no object-initializer state). Rules ship at Info (non-breaking; promoted to Error later). New [AggregateStateInitializer] attribute marks the sanctioned rehydrate opt-out. See docs/EventSourcing.md and CHANGELOG.md.",
